Keys ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  more above
  enter                add
  backspace, ctrl+h    delete
 CTO box
  ctrl+], tab          back to Sessions
  esc                  skip tip
  enter                opens the full CTO
  pgup, ctrl+u         scroll
  pgdown, ctrl+d       scroll
  m                    model
  n                    new
  u                    undo
  w                    drive
 help
  T                    toggle tips
  R                    restart tips
  N                    desktop notifications: on (toggle)
  q                    quit
  esc, ?               close help
  down, j              scroll down
  up, k                scroll up
  pgdown               page down
  pgup                 page up
  home, g              first line
  end, G               last line
 confirmations
  enter, y, Y          yes
  esc, n, N            no
 forms
  enter                submit or next field
  esc                  cancel
  tab                  move to the next field
  down                 next field
  shift+tab, up        previous field
  left                 change choice
  right                change choice
  space                toggle

up/down scroll  esc close help  q quit
